.gov.uk/defence-and-armed-forces/veterans-family-support","withdrawn":false}]},"locale":"en","phase":"live","public_updated_at":"2026-06-09T12:08:42+01:00","publishing_app":"whitehall","publishing_request_id":"21-1781003322.836-10.13.22.74-2366","publishing_scheduled_at":null,"rendering_app":"frontend","scheduled_publishing_delay_seconds":null,"schema_name":"news_article","title":"Defence Housing Service appoints Chair as new data shows military housing 'turning the corner’","updated_at":"2026-08-14T17:39:37+01:00","withdrawn_notice":{}}